import R4Common

/-! # CF 2025: Property (P3-P7; generated by R4/tools/gen_pkgs.py from specs/pkgs/cf.json)

Contribution foncière des propriétés bâties (15 % of rental value less 40 %, at least 30 000 F; main home exempt) (CGI 2017 (edition 2023) art. 169 12°, 170, 177): art. 170: base = rental value less 40 % for wear and upkeep; art. 177: 15 % for individuals and bodies not liable to IS (30 % for IS payers), at least 30 000 F; art. 169 12°: the first dwelling occupied as main residence by the owner or family is exempt (the household's home), other buildings taxed.

Contribution foncière des propriétés non bâties (27,5 % of 12 % of market value in urban centres) (CGI 2017 (edition 2023) art. 180 a), 184): art. 180 a): in urban centres the taxable income is 12 % of the market value; art. 184: rate 27,5 % — i.e. 3,3 % of the market value, applied in one step.

Droit d'enregistrement, mutations d'immeubles bâtis (7,5 %) (CGI 2017 (edition 2023) art. 77, 301): art. 77: sales of immovables are subject to the high rate (15 %, art. 301); art. 301 reduces it to 7,5 % for deeds and transfers of built immovables and to 6 % for urban unbuilt and rural built immovables.

Droit d'enregistrement, mutations d'immeubles urbains non bâtis (6 %) (CGI 2017 (edition 2023) art. 301): art. 301: 6 % for deeds and transfers of urban unbuilt immovables (land taken as urban). -/

